    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "“Your turn, Red.” plus the synthetic attack-to-policy-decision comparison creates a coherent demo narrative, reinforced by the cyan/pink adversarial palette across all viewports. However, the actual visual vocabulary—dark panels, neon sliders, status pills, progress bars, monospace labels, and oversized risk score—is familiar cyber-dashboard styling. The screenshots show no singular visual metaphor, transition, or result reveal distinctive enough to make the composer instantly recognizable.",
